x, (min-width:800px) and (max-width: 999px) 166.5px, (min-width:1000px) 200px\" src=\"https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_2573-400x225.jpg\" srcset=\"https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_2573-400x225.jpg 400w, https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_2573-800x450.jpg 800w, https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_2573-1200x675.jpg 1200w\" width=\"400\"/></a><div class=\"entry-wrap entry-wrap-grid\"><h3 class=\"entry-title\"><a class=\"entry-title-link\" data-content-piece=\"6 L.A. Restaurants Cooking Up Innovative Culinary Hybrids\" href=\"https://lamag.com/food/6-l-a-restaurants-cooking-up-innovative-culinary-hybrids/\" rel=\"bookmark\">6 L.A. Restaurants Cooking Up Innovative Culinary Hybrids</a></h3>\n</div></article></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mai-column is-column\" style=\"--columns-xs:1 / 1;--flex-xs:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-sm:1 / 2;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1 / 2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1 / 2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;\">\n<div class=\"mai-grid entries entries-grid has-image-full\" style=\"--entry-title-font-size:var(--font-size-lg);--align-text:start;--entry-meta-text-align:start;\"><div class=\"entries-wrap has-columns\" style=\"--columns-xs:1 / 1;--columns-sm:1 / 1;--columns-md:1 / 1;--columns-lg:1 / 1;--flex-xs:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--column-gap:var(--spacing-lg);--row-gap:var(--spacing-lg);--align-columns:start;\"><article aria-label=\"It’s National Text Your Ex Day – Why Fall Has Us Reaching for Our Exes\" class=\"entry entry-grid is-column has-entry-link has-image has-image-first type-post category-dating category-sex-dating tag-dating tag-scorpio tag-text-your-ex-day tag-texting\" style=\"--entry-index:1;\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"entry-image-link\" href=\"https://lamag.com/dating/its-national-text-your-ex-day-why-fall-has-us-reaching-for-our-exes/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img alt=\"Jennifer Lopez and Ben Affleck\" class=\"entry-image size-landscape-sm\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:599px) 599px, (min-width:600px) and (max-width: 799px) 799px, (min-width:800px) and (max-width: 999px) 666px, (min-width:1000px) 800px\" src=\"https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-30-at-1.16.02-PM-400x225.png\" srcset=\"https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-30-at-1.16.02-PM-400x225.png 400w, https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-30-at-1.16.02-PM-800x450.png 800w, https://lamag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-30-at-1.16.02-PM-1200x675.png 1200w\" width=\"400\"/></a><div class=\"entry-wrap entry-wrap-grid\"><h3 class=\"entry-title\"><a class=\"entry-title-link\" data-content-piece=\"It’s National Text Your Ex Day – Why Fall Has Us Reaching for Our Exes\" href=\"https://lamag.com/dating/its-national-text-your-ex-day-why-fall-has-us-reaching-for-our-exes/\" rel=\"bookmark\">It’s National Text Your Ex Day – Why Fall Has Us Reaching for Our Exes</a></h3>\n</div></article></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-border has-alt-background-color has-background has-light-background has-xl-content-width has-sm-padding-top has-sm-padding-bottom has-lg-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"mai-ad-unit-container\" style=\"--mai-ad-unit-width-sm:320px;--mai-ad-unit-height-sm:100px;--mai-ad-unit-width-md:728px;--mai-ad-unit-height-md:100px;--mai-ad-unit-width-lg:750px;--mai-ad-unit-height-lg:100px;\"><div class=\"mai-ad-unit\" data-al=\"content\" data-ap=\"btf\" data-content-name=\"mai-ad-content-leaderboard\" data-label=\"Sponsored\" data-location=\"cn\" data-track-content=\"\" data-unit=\"leaderboard\" id=\"mai-ad-leaderboard\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><em>Bee </em>reporter Hannah Wiley attempted to trace every state senator and assembly member to confirm the full list of California lawmakers that participated in the luxurious affair.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-embed-twitter\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:540px;\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%;\"><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/hannahcwiley/status/1328801993498849280\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/hannahcwiley/status/1328801993498849280</a></p></blockquote>\n</figure>\n<p> Her reporting found that L.A.-area state senators Steven Bradford, Lena Gonzalez, Robert Hertzberg, Holly Mitchell, Anthony Portantino, Henry Stern, and assembly members Anthony Rendon, Ian Calderon, Phillip Chen, Sabrina Cervantes, Freddie Rodriguez, Laura Friedman, Chris Holden, Luz Rivas, Jesse Gabriel, Richard Bloom, and Autumn Burke are all among the lawmakers who declined to go to Hawaii to hobnob with lobbyists.</p><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-border has-alt-background-color has-background has-light-background has-xl-content-width has-sm-padding-top has-sm-padding-bottom has-lg-margin-top has-lg-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"mai-ad-unit-container\" style=\"--mai-ad-unit-width-sm:336px;--mai-ad-unit-height-sm:280px;--mai-ad-unit-width-md:728px;--mai-ad-unit-height-md:280px;--mai-ad-unit-width-lg:750px;--mai-ad-unit-height-lg:300px;\"><div class=\"mai-ad-unit\" data-al=\"content\" data-ap=\"btf\" data-content-name=\"mai-ad-content-billboard-2\" data-label=\"Sponsored\" data-track-content=\"\" data-unit=\"billboard\" id=\"mai-ad-billboard-2\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p> News of the legislators attending the event comes just days after <a href=\"https://www.sfchronicle.com/politics/article/Newsom-on-French-Laundry-dinner-party-I-made-15731565.php\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Governor Gavin Newsom was himself caught</a> breaking pandemic guidelines. Newsom and his family attended a large, multi-household birthday dinner thrown by a lobbyist at the luxurious French Laundry restaurant in Yountville.</p>\n<p><strong>RELATED: <a href=\"https://www.lamag.com/citythinkblog/holiday-travel-covid-19/\">As the Holidays Approach and COVID Surges, California Issues a Travel Advisory</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Stay on top of the latest in L.A. food and culture. <a href=\"http://www.lamag.com/newsletters/\">Sign up for our newsletters today.</a></em></strong></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"entry-custom-content\"><p style=\"font-family:var(--alt-font-family);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:var(--spacing-sm)\">Don’t keep it to yourself…share the love!</p>\n<div class=\"shared-counts-wrap shortcode style-mai-share\"><a class=\"shared-counts-button facebook shared-counts-no-count\" data-postid=\"220069\" data-social-action=\"Share\" data-social-network=\"Facebook\" data-social-target=\"https://lamag.com/news-and-politics/maui-lawmakers-pandemic/\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://lamag.com/news-and-politics/maui-lawmakers-pandemic/&amp;display=popup&amp;ref=plugin&amp;src=share_button\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Share on Facebook\"><span class=\"shared-counts-icon-label\"><span class=\"shared-counts-icon\"><svg height=\"32\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 602 1024\" width=\"18.8125\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M548 6.857v150.857h-89.714q-49.143 0-66.286 20.571t-17.143 61.714v108h167.429l-22.286 169.143h-145.143v433.714h-174.857v-433.714h-145.714v-169.143h145.714v-124.571q0-106.286 59.429-164.857t158.286-58.571q84 0 130.286 6.857z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"shared-counts-label\">Facebook</span></span></a><a class=\"shared-counts-button twitter shared-counts-no-count\" data-postid=\"220069\" data-social-action=\"Tweet\" data-socia